Package: veida
Type: Package
Title: Generate AI Images with No API Key
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Veida", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@veida.ai")
Description: A small client for the Veida AI image generator <https://veida.ai>.
    It uses the anonymous free tier, so the first call works on a machine with
    nothing configured: 1K output, watermarked, about seven images a day per
    machine.
